fer_ros2

This project is a ROS 2 Jazzy port of the real-robot Franka Emika Robot (FER /
"Panda") driver stack, derived from multipanda_ros2:

    https://github.com/tenfoldpaper/multipanda_ros2
    branch: humble, commit: ad741e3ffcbe44cf47f7138ac8659802a3c9e43b

multipanda_ros2 is itself a fork and extension of franka_ros2, originally
ported to ROS 2 Humble by Maciej Bednarczyk (mcbed):

    https://github.com/mcbed/franka_ros2/tree/humble

franka_ros2 was originally authored by Franka Emika GmbH:

    Copyright 2021 Franka Emika GmbH

The initial commit of this repository is a verbatim, unmodified import of
the packages listed below, taken from multipanda_ros2 at the commit pinned
above. All subsequent modifications (ROS 2 Jazzy compatibility, removal of
simulation/MuJoCo/multi-arm code, bug fixes, renaming) are recorded as
separate commits on top of that import, so the diff against upstream stays
inspectable and upstream fixes remain cherry-pickable.

Packages imported: franka_bringup, franka_example_controllers,
franka_gripper, franka_hardware, franka_msgs, franka_multi_mode_controller,
franka_robot_state_broadcaster, franka_semantic_components.

